Modifications by Hyssos Tech
----------------------------

This is a MODIFIED copy. Per Section 4(b) of the Apache License, the
following changes were made by Hyssos Tech for use in the Sketch-Thru-Plan
.NET SDK (HyssosTech.Sdk.STP). The authoritative, detailed list is in
STP.md in this folder; summarized here:

  * Repackaged as a modern SDK-style project (JMSML.csproj) targeting
    net8.0;netstandard2.0 (the original shipped as a .NET Framework project).
  * Librarian.ConfigData exposed as a public property.
  * Logging dependency changed from NLog to Microsoft.Extensions.Logging
    (ILogger), injected through the Librarian constructor; LogExtension and
    LogManager shim classes were added to preserve the original call sites.
  * Conversion-status logging noise reduced: only fatal unresolved fields
    (status bits 0-11) are reported, suppressing benign "Not Found"
    diagnostics for entity sub-types / modifiers (librarian.cs).
  * Runtime symbol data (jmsmlSTP.config, the Instance/*.xml symbol set) and
    the SVG graphic set are supplied by the consuming SDK package rather than
    by this project.

These modifications are likewise distributed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.

Dependency note: System.Drawing.Common is intentionally pinned to version 5,
the last release with cross-platform support.
